# Lorica benchmark

Run 2026-11-08 with model `nvidia/nemotron-3-ultra-550b-a55b:free` and the `chill` profile. 97 of 97 real bugs from 10 open-source repositories reviewed with diff + code-graph context, as in production. Reproduce with `pnpm benchmark run`.

## Results (diff + code graph)

| Metric | Value |
| --- | --- |
| Real bugs identified (finding describes the fixed defect) | not judged yet (12 / 97 judged) |
| Real bugs flagged (finding within 3 lines of the defect) | 86 / 97 (89%) |
| Valid structured responses | 97 / 97 (100%) |
| Review time, median | 20.6s |
| Review time, p90 | 110.1s |
| Findings per review, mean | 1.3 |
| Graph traces per review | median 27, max 40 |
| Indexing the buggy commit (clone, parse, persist to Neo4j), median | 26.5s over 97 commits |
| Prompt tokens removed by file filtering | 24% (116,471 → 88,443 est. tokens over 40 PRs; 12 PRs had files filtered) |

## Comparison: with graph vs diff only

The 27 cases reviewed both with graph context and with the diff alone, without code-graph evidence.

| Metric | With graph | Diff only |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Real bugs identified | not judged yet (12 / 27 judged) | **22 / 27 (81%)** |
| Real bugs flagged | 26 / 27 (96%) | 26 / 27 (96%) |
| Review time, median | 23.0s | 32.7s |
| Findings per review, mean | 1.5 | 1.4 |


